{"page":156,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:44","surah":7,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"وَنَادَىٰٓ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْجَنَّةِ أَصْحَـٰبَ ٱلنَّارِ أَن قَدْ وَجَدْنَا مَا وَعَدَنَا رَبُّنَا حَقًّا فَهَلْ وَجَدتُّم مَّا وَعَدَ رَبُّكُمْ حَقًّا ۖ قَالُوا۟ نَعَمْ ۚ فَأَذَّنَ مُؤَذِّنٌۢ بَيْنَهُمْ أَن لَّعْنَةُ ٱللَّهِ عَلَى ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The people of the Garden will cry out to the people of the Fire, ‘We have found what our Lord promised us to be true. Have you found what your Lord promised you to be true?’ and they will answer, ‘Yes’. A voice will proclaim from their midst, ‘God’s rejection [hangs] over the evildoers:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَنَادَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"And will call out","transliteration":"wanādā","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","en_gloss":"(the) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ","en_gloss":"(of) Paradise","transliteration":"l-janati","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"(to the) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥāba","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَجَدْنَا","en_gloss":"we found","transliteration":"wajadnā","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَعَدَنَا","en_gloss":"(had) promised us","transliteration":"waʿadanā","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":11,"ar":"رَبُّنَا","en_gloss":"our Lord","transliteration":"rabbunā","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":12,"ar":"حَقًّۭا","en_gloss":"true","transliteration":"ḥaqqan","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَهَلْ","en_gloss":"So have","transliteration":"fahal","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَجَدتُّم","en_gloss":"you found","transliteration":"wajadttum","verse_key":"7:44"},{"pos":1